comments.body:
Note we already do review and update lint rules weekly, we just haven't found rules to delete yet AFAICT. That said, I'm sure the rules could be improved if someone wanted to invest in it.

I don't think we have any rules in the ml-lint category that can be mechanized, we already use Ruff for that type of stuff. I'm not sure the recall numbers make a lot of sense in isolation; last I checked the live evidence suggests that the rules trigger on every PR.

@weaverbot can you make a table from the finelog data for how many lint rules trigger per PR broken down by lint rule and across all rules
